#* {{quote-book|en|author=Sam Jefferson|chapter=In the land of the lotus eaters|title=The Sea Devil: The Adventures of Count Felix von Luckner, the Last Raider under Sail|location=London; New York, N.Y.|publisher=w:Osprey Publishing|year=2017|page=118|pageurl=https://books.google.com/books?id=MqE2DwAAQBAJ&pg=PA118|isbn=978-1-4728-2788-3|passage=[T]heir first thoughts after finding out if they were still at war was of '''kartoffels''' and comic supplements.}}

